<title>USA: US Industries authorized to buy more shares.</title>
<headline>US Industries authorized to buy more shares.</headline>
<dateline>ISELIN, N.J. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Industries Inc said Tuesday it authorized a $50 million increase in its share buyback plan.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors previously authorized share purchases of up to $50 million. Of that authorization, 2.4 million shares have already been purchased for a total of $45.7 million.</p>
<p>The company will now have the option of repurchasing an additional $54.3 million in shares. Purchases may be made from time to time, in the open market or privately, at prices acceptable to management, the company said.</p>
</text>
